		<h2 id="theme">Light, dark and system</h2>
		<p>
			<code>theme</code>
			belongs to the framework. It stores the preference and applies
			<code>data-theme</code>
			before the first paint.
			<MeekoLink to="/theme-toggle">UIThemeToggle</MeekoLink>
			lets readers change it, also without JavaScript. Tokens change by themselves: do not write rules per theme.
		</p>
		<h2 id="palette">The palette</h2>
		<p>Each scale has 12 steps: 1 and 2 for backgrounds, 3 to 5 for controls, 6 to 8 for borders, 9 and 10 for solids, 11 and 12 for text. The background is pure white in light and pure black in dark. Violet is for the main action, the focus, the selection and what is active: if everything is violet, nothing stands out.</p>
		<h3 id="scale-primary"><code>--ui-color-primary-*</code></h3>
